-- en: "Current AzeriteUI series. Retail, Forever, Classic Era, TBC and Mists Classic. Action buttons come from LibActionButton-1.0."
L["Current AzeriteUI series. Retail, Forever, Classic Era, TBC and Mists Classic. Action buttons come from LibActionButton-1.0."] = "目前的 AzeriteUI 系列。正式版、永久、經典時代、TBC 與潘達利亞之謎經典版。動作按鈕來自 LibActionButton-1.0。"
-- en: "Official project page. This page requires JavaScript; edition metadata was not independently readable."
L["Official project page. This page requires JavaScript; edition metadata was not independently readable."] = "官方專案頁面。此頁面需要 JavaScript；無法獨立讀取適用版本中繼資料。"
-- en: "Full EllesmereUI suite including the Action Bars module. Retail and Forever."
L["Full EllesmereUI suite including the Action Bars module. Retail and Forever."] = "完整的 EllesmereUI 套件，包含動作列模組。正式版與永久。"
-- en: "Standalone Action Bars only. Retail and Forever. Its install folder was not confirmed; RM also recognizes the bars by the frames they create."
L["Standalone Action Bars only. Retail and Forever. Its install folder was not confirmed; RM also recognizes the bars by the frames they create."] = "僅包含獨立的動作列。正式版與永久。其安裝資料夾未經確認；RM 也會透過動作列建立的框架來辨識它們。"
-- en: "Official source repository. The action bars are the EllesmereUIActionBars folder. Source availability does not certify integration behavior."
L["Official source repository. The action bars are the EllesmereUIActionBars folder. Source availability does not certify integration behavior."] = "官方原始碼儲存庫。動作列即 EllesmereUIActionBars 資料夾。有原始碼可用並不代表認證了整合行為。"
-- en: "BigWigs plugin for dungeon and delve bosses. Requires BigWigs and feeds the same bars and stages, so the BigWigs row covers it; no separate RM connection."
L["BigWigs plugin for dungeon and delve bosses. Requires BigWigs and feeds the same bars and stages, so the BigWigs row covers it; no separate RM connection."] = "適用於地城與探索副本首領的 BigWigs 外掛。需要 BigWigs，並提供相同的計時條與階段，因此 BigWigs 一列已涵蓋它；沒有單獨的 RM 連線。"
-- en: "DBM module pack for dungeons, delves and events. Requires DBM-Core and registers through it, so the DBM row covers it; no separate RM connection."
L["DBM module pack for dungeons, delves and events. Requires DBM-Core and registers through it, so the DBM row covers it; no separate RM connection."] = "適用於地城、探索副本與事件的 DBM 模組包。需要 DBM-Core 並透過它註冊，因此 DBM 一列已涵蓋它；沒有單獨的 RM 連線。"
