L["Official project page. Publisher lists Retail, Classic Era, Classic progression, TBC. Choose the matching file; exact patch and RM integration behavior may be unverified."] = "官方專案頁面。發布者列出了正式版、經典時代、經典進程、TBC。請選擇相應的檔案；確切的修補版本與 RM 整合行為可能未經驗證。"
